@startuml bossfight-phase
!include _style.puml
title Mantis Lords Boss Fight — Phase Machine (BossFightController)

[*] --> Dormant

state Dormant : left/right asleep,\nmiddle on throne
Dormant --> Phase1_Middle : fight engaged /\nEngageArenaLock()

state Phase1_Middle : middle lord attacks solo
Phase1_Middle --> Phase2_Transition : middle.IsInWoundedPose

state Phase2_Transition : wait MantisSiblingStaggerDelay
Phase2_Transition --> Phase2_Sides : delay done /\nLeft.CommandActivate(),\nRight.CommandActivate()

state Phase2_Sides : left + right attack as\nleader/follower pairs (synchronised)
Phase2_Sides --> Phase3_Solo : one lord wounded
Phase2_Sides --> Victory_Bow : both lords wounded

state Phase3_Solo : surviving lord attacks solo
Phase3_Solo --> Victory_Bow : solo lord wounded

state Victory_Bow : all survivors CommandBow()
Victory_Bow --> Done : all IsBowComplete /\ndisengage arena lock

Done --> [*]

@enduml
